---
// Catálogo Pantallas - 26.0% del negocio
---

<section class="pipod-pantallas-section">
  <div class="pipod-container">
    <div class="pipod-section-header">
      <h2 class="pipod-section-title">PANTALLAS CERTIFICADAS</h2>
    </div>
    
    <div class="pipod-pantallas-grid">
      <!-- Pantalla iPhone -->
      <div class="pipod-screen-card">
        <div class="pipod-card-content">
          <div class="pipod-screen-icon">
            <i class="bi bi-phone"></i>
          </div>
          <h3 class="pipod-screen-title">Cambio de Pantalla iPhone</h3>
          
          <div class="pipod-specs-container">
            <div class="pipod-spec-row">
              <span class="pipod-spec-label">PRECIO:</span>
              <span class="pipod-spec-value">Desde $46.000</span>
            </div>
            <div class="pipod-spec-row">
              <span class="pipod-spec-label">TIEMPO:</span>
              <span class="pipod-spec-value pipod-express">2 HORAS EXPRESS</span>
            </div>
            <div class="pipod-spec-row">
              <span class="pipod-spec-label">TIPO:</span>
              <span class="pipod-spec-value">Cristal + LCD</span>
            </div>
            <div class="pipod-spec-row">
              <span class="pipod-spec-label">GARANTÍA:</span>
              <span class="pipod-spec-value">12 Meses</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <ul class="pipod-checklist">
            <li><span class="dot-check"></span> Cristal anti-rayos</li>
            <li><span class="dot-check"></span> Ajuste de brillo original</li>
            <li><span class="dot-check"></span> True Tone recalibrado</li>
            <li><span class="dot-check"></span> Cambio en sucursal</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <a href="https://wa.me/573124813094?text=Hola%20Pipod%2C%20quiero%20cambiar%20pantalla%20iPhone" class="pipod-btn-bento">Agendar Cambio</a>
      </div>

      <!-- Pantalla iPad -->
      <div class="pipod-screen-card">
        <div class="pipod-card-content">
          <div class="pipod-screen-icon">
            <i class="bi bi-tablet"></i>
          </div>
          <h3 class="pipod-screen-title">Cambio de Pantalla iPad</h3>
          
          <div class="pipod-specs-container">
            <div class="pipod-spec-row">
              <span class="pipod-spec-label">PRECIO:</span>
              <span class="pipod-spec-value">Desde $65.000</span>
            </div>
            <div class="pipod-spec-row">
              <span class="pipod-spec-label">TIEMPO:</span>
              <span class="pipod-spec-value">3-4 HORAS</span>
            </div>
            <div class="pipod-spec-row">
              <span class="pipod-spec-label">TIPO:</span>
              <span class="pipod-spec-value">Cristal Retina</span>
            </div>
            <div class="pipod-spec-row">
              <span class="pipod-spec-label">GARANTÍA:</span>
              <span class="pipod-spec-value">12 Meses</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <ul class="pipod-checklist">
            <li><span class="dot-check"></span> Digitalizador táctil</li>
            <li><span class="dot-check"></span> Sensor de luz ajustado</li>
            <li><span class="dot-check"></span> Sellado contra polvo</li>
            <li><span class="dot-check"></span> Calibración de presión</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <a href="https://wa.me/573124813094?text=Hola%20Pipod%2C%20quiero%20cambiar%20pantalla%20iPad" class="pipod-btn-bento">Agendar Cambio</a>
      </div>

      <!-- Pantalla MacBook -->
      <div class="pipod-screen-card">
        <div class="pipod-card-content">
          <div class="pipod-screen-icon">
            <i class="bi bi-laptop"></i>
          </div>
          <h3 class="pipod-screen-title">Cambio de Pantalla MacBook</h3>
          
          <div class="pipod-specs-container">
            <div class="pipod-spec-row">
              <span class="pipod-spec-label">PRECIO:</span>
              <span class="pipod-spec-value">Desde $380.000</span>
            </div>
            <div class="pipod-spec-row">
              <span class="pipod-spec-label">TIEMPO:</span>
              <span class="pipod-spec-value">6-8 HORAS</span>
            </div>
            <div class="pipod-spec-row">
              <span class="pipod-spec-label">TIPO:</span>
              <span class="pipod-spec-value">Retina + Logic</span>
            </div>
            <div class="pipod-spec-row">
              <span class="pipod-spec-label">GARANTÍA:</span>
              <span class="pipod-spec-value">12 Meses</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <ul class="pipod-checklist">
            <li><span class="dot-check"></span> Micro-soldadura si necesaria</li>
            <li><span class="dot-check"></span> Backlight LED reemplazado</li>
            <li><span class="dot-check"></span> Sensor ambiental recalibrado</li>
            <li><span class="dot-check"></span> True Tone restaurado</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <a href="https://wa.me/573124813094?text=Hola%20Pipod%2C%20quiero%20cambiar%20pantalla%20MacBook" class="pipod-btn-bento">Agendar Cambio</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- FAQ Pantallas -->
    <div class="pipod-faq-section">
      <h4 class="pipod-faq-title">PREGUNTAS FRECUENTES</h4>
      <div class="pipod-faq-container">
        <details class="pipod-faq-item">
          <summary>¿Pueden reparar grietas o solo cambiar?</summary>
          <p>Si la grieta es de cristal sin dañar LCD, podemos solo cambiar cristal ($25-30k). Si LCD está dañado, es cambio total.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="pipod-faq-item">
          <summary>¿El vidrio es original Apple?</summary>
          <p>Cristal certificado Corning Gorilla Glass. Mismo tipo que usa Apple, no remanufacturado.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="pipod-faq-item">
          <summary>¿Se ve igual que la original?</summary>
          <p>Sí. Mismo brillo, True Tone, colores y respuesta táctil.</p>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;600;700&display=swap');

  .pipod-pantallas-section {
    background-color: #FFFFFF;
    padding: 80px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid #E5E5E5;
  }

  .pipod-container {
    max-width: 1440px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 80px;
  }

  .pipod-section-title {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #000000;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .pipod-pantallas-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(1, 1fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 60px;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .pipod-pantallas-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    }
  }

  .pipod-screen-card {
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border: 0.85px solid #000000;
    border-radius: 24px;
    padding: 35px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.165, 0.84, 0.44, 1);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.03);
    min-height: 520px;
  }

  .pipod-screen-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-8px);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
  }

  .pipod-screen-icon {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    color: #000000;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .pipod-screen-title {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #000000;
    margin-bottom: 25px;
    line-height: 1.2;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .pipod-specs-container {
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    padding-top: 0;
    border-top: none;
  }

  .pipod-spec-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .pipod-spec-label {
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #333333;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .pipod-spec-value {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #000000;
  }

  .pipod-express {
    color: #000000;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 4px;
  }

  .pipod-checklist {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0 0 30px 0;
  }

  .pipod-checklist li {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #555;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .dot-check {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    background-color: #000;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: inline-block;
  }

  .pipod-btn-bento {
    background: #000000;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 14px 25px;
    border-radius: 50px;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    display: block;
  }

  .pipod-btn-bento:hover {
    background: #333333;
    transform: scale(1.02);
  }

  .pipod-faq-section {
    border-top: 1px solid #E5E5E5;
    padding-top: 60px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .pipod-faq-title {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .pipod-faq-container {
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .pipod-faq-item {
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    padding-bottom: 20px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #F9F9F9;
  }

  .pipod-faq-item summary {
    font-weight: 600;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: #000;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .pipod-faq-item p {
    margin-top: 15px;
    color: #666;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .pipod-container {
      padding: 0 24px;
    }

    .pipod-pantallas-section {
      padding: 40px 0;
    }

    .pipod-section-title {
      font-size: 1.8rem;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }

    .pipod-screen-card {
      padding: 24px;
      min-height: auto;
    }

    .pipod-screen-title {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
    }

    .pipod-faq-section {
      padding-top: 40px;
    }
  }
</style>
